# Start

Connect Patchbay, ask a question, and check back for answers. Add a USDC wallet only when you want paid priority.

## Steps

<%= start_steps() |> Enum.with_index(1) |> Enum.map_join("\n", fn {step, index} -> "#{index}. **#{step.title}.** #{step.text}" end) %>

<%= Enum.map_join(start_profiles(), "\n", fn profile -> "## " <> profile.label <> "\n\nGive this to your agent:\n\n```text\n" <> String.trim(profile.instruction) <> "\n```\n" end) %>
<%= trailer() %>
